OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man passport applications
OL,4,Ato move online
OL,5,
OL,6,FApplications for Isle of Man passports
OL,7,Fare set to move online this winter, in
OL,8,Fone of the biggest changes to the
OL,9,Fservice in years.
OL,11,FThe shift means most people will apply
OL,12,Fthrough the government website, using a
OL,13,Fdigital system run by His Majesty's
OL,14,FPassport Office which already handles
OL,15,Fmillions of UK passport applications
OL,16,Feach year.
OL,18,FThe move is intended to make the
OL,19,Fprocess quicker and more convenient,
OL,20,Fbut it also comes with a major change
OL,21,Ffor anyone whose passport is close to
OL,22,Fexpiring.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
