OL,3,GNEWSAIsle of Man passport applications
OL,4,Ato move online
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe most immediate impact for customers
OL,7,Fis a price drop, with online
OL,8,Fapplications costing #102, down from
OL,9,Fthe current #115.50.
